# Scientific Visual Studio Rule for Cursor & Codex

When authoring slides, video scripts, or academic papers:
1. Classify the pedagogical goal (Axiom Math, Quantum State, Neural Topology, Frequency Domain, Workflow DAG).
2. Choose a cyber-academic layout (`render_cyber_academic_dashboard_layout`, `render_triptych_pipeline_layout`).
3. Fill data props into `scientific_visual_studio` renderers.
4. Output self-contained HTML/SVG with zero runtime C++ dependencies.
